  "trust_boundary_evidence": [
    {
      "source": "verifiers/compare_harness_independent.py:41-50",
      "quote": "Full producer payloads must carry these maps, and every row channel must reconcile with them; a caller cannot change only a row's mode, verdict or source-summary value and retain a green join. These are consistency checks, not provenance authentication: a caller who rewrites the rows, mirrors and summary coherently can still fabricate a --live-json document. The comparator has no signature or trusted producer receipt to distinguish that forgery, so the claim is bounded to contradictory copies rather than arbitrary caller-authored JSON."
    },
    {
      "source": ".ufo/round-46/scouts/H1.md:19,22-26,49",
      "quote": "In --live-json mode, none of the live measurements is re-derived from the host. The row mode is what parse_live returns and compare uses; the map is a mirror, not an independently sourced rule, and supported modes are not authenticated against the producer's CHECKS table. The row verdicts are not recomputed from the live observation or baseline. The live receipt is an input digest, not a producer signature or attestation. The candidate's consistency contract does not turn --live-json into authenticated evidence."
    },
    {
      "source": ".ufo/round-46/scouts/V4.md:11",
      "quote": "With --live-json, the comparator reads the caller-selected file directly and sets its input exit to 0; it does not rerun the live producer. Row-level mode/verdict are trusted from the supplied bytes; this does not establish producer provenance."
    },
    {
      "source": "verifiers/harness-independent-scope.json:5-6",
      "quote": "This file is the AUTHORITATIVE scope-out set. The comparator reads it from here, never from the payload under test, so a builder cannot make a check leave the join by self-declaration. Each payload reason and scoped-row evidence string must match the committed row; each blind probe must match the committed kind and target before recomputation.",
      "relevance": "Scope-out contract only; it does not declare live-JSON producer trust."
    }
  ],
